I need a shawl for the bright sun outside.
I ask the saleswoman.
She brings a white cotton shawl.
I wear that shawl.
I put it on my shoulders.
This is a very big shawl.
This white shawl is good.
I ask the price.
The saleswoman says.
"It is two hundred rupees for this."
Two hundred rupees is a small price.
I like this shawl.
I take this shawl.
I put it with the yellow kurti.
